<title>USA: Henderson, Nev. $14.55 mln won by Hutchinson.</title>
<headline>Henderson, Nev. $14.55 mln won by Hutchinson.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchinson Shockey, Erley &amp; Co. said it won $14.550 million of Henderson, Nev., general obligation building bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.395 percent.</p>
</text>
